# Copy to .env for local runs (npm start). On Vercel, set these in Project Settings → Environment Variables.
# No AI keys: speech to text and the coach model run in the browser.
# Nothing is required. The app has no sign-in and stores nothing about calls.
# Only needed to keep links shared by an earlier version working: the cookie key for their codes.
# APP_PASSCODE=
# SESSION_SECRET=
